      "content": "The Certificate Manager API provides programmatic access to manage TLS certificates, certificate maps, DNS authorizations, and certificate issuance configurations for Google Cloud. It supports automated provisioning and renewal of Google-managed certificates and upload of self-managed certificates.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Google Cloud Support",
